{"id":"9e8e67daef36dae6","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-prop-type-over-parameters.md","title":"Type Over Parameters","display":"prop-type-over-parameters — Type Over Parameters","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-type-over-parameters","aliases":["58-prop-type-over-parameters"],"display":"prop-type-over-parameters — Type Over Parameters","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-parameters.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-type-over-parameters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-type-over-parameters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-type-over-parameters — Type Over Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"453a692642e0bff9\" href=\"?note=453a692642e0bff9\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md\">../batch15/58-df-parameters.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq M\">\\(A\\subseteq M\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in M^r\">\\(\\vec a\\in M^r\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"453a692642e0bff9\" href=\"?note=453a692642e0bff9\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md\">../batch15/58-df-parameters.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)\\in V\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"453a692642e0bff9\" href=\"?note=453a692642e0bff9\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md\">../batch15/58-df-parameters.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}type\\text{-}over\\text{-}parameters} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\nA\\subseteq M\\land\\vec a\\in M^r\n\\to\n\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)=\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\vec b\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\vec b\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}type\\text{-}over\\text{-}parameters} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\nA\\subseteq M\\land\\vec a\\in M^r\n\\to\n\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)=\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\vec b\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\vec b\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The structure, language, carrier, tuple arity, formula code, and parameter tuple are explicit. The conclusion exactly matches the upstream pair-coded type and its sourced tuple-truth relation.</li>\n<li>The type of an element determines its theory relative to parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md","status":"resolved","id":"453a692642e0bff9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-parameters.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md","status":"resolved","id":"453a692642e0bff9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\in\\omega$, $M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)$, $A\\subseteq M$, and $\\vec a\\in M^r$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-parameters.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-parameters.md","status":"resolved","id":"453a692642e0bff9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)$, $\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S$, and $\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)\\in V$ are as in [[../batch15/58-df-parameters.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in M^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}type\\text{-}over\\text{-}parameters} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\nA\\subseteq M\\land\\vec a\\in M^r\n\\to\n\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L}(\\vec a/A)=\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\vec b\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\vec b\\in A^{<\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1468,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4008","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-prop-type-over-parameters.md|58-prop-type-over-parameters]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["453a692642e0bff9","65418b505fc53093"]}